      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate experienced a gross reserve strengthening of GBP 13.801 million for prior underwriting years (2016, 2017, and 2018), representing 7.27% of its opening gross reserves. This adverse development is attributed to the exceptional impact of COVID-19, particularly on contingency class, and the consideration of future recessionary impacts on reserves. Underlying liability estimates are influenced by assumptions regarding claims development patterns, average claim costs, handling costs, inflation factors, and claim numbers, with qualitative judgements applied for market factors, public attitude to claiming, economic conditions, portfolio mix, policy conditions, claims handling procedures, judicial decisions, and government legislation.",
